// any brightness, colour, tone ... adjust by double clicking. make the filter smaller. nothing on sides"; "remove the outline of the octopus,
// remove the stuff in tank, add sea weed on ocean floor"; mockups/octopus-v1-*.png to octopus-v3-bottom-leds.png). A dark room of its own out
// in the blackness (LBLD 'locto', 21-world-map-5-land: off the map, the jump list takes you there), 12 by 9, nothing in it but the tank.
// The room: walls of dark blue-grey plaster over a black skirting, a polished dark concrete floor; no light but the tank's.
// The tank (owner, 16 Oct 2026: "lets make the tanks less complex, just glass and water for now, and plaque with info"): a long glass tank of
// open sea (DEEPW's, real water) on a plain walnut stand, the brass plaque on its front (double-click: what it says, 47-octopus-2-view), the
// glass's black frame; lit by lights round the foot of the glass, unseen, any brightness, colour and tone (double-click it), lighting the water
// from low and the room with it. In the water only the seaweed and the octopus (47-octopus-1-animal). Placed last of all: 26-zzzzzzzzzz-octopus-placed.
// =====================================================================================
