// "a small atrium with 2 different rare butterflies", 23-w-studio-mood): twelve of New York's summer and the twenty rarest in the world,
// each drawn from its real wings in code (no image): a half-wing's outline by family (u out from the body 0-1, v forward + and back -, in
// half-spans), its colours a pattern over it (fore: the forewing; rim: how far in from the wing's edge, small at the edge). Their pictures
// (bfPic) at any size, in three poses; their size in the world (bfSpan: twice real, never under 6 art px). The kinds and pictures only, as
