// THE CASTLE'S STONE (owner, 16 Oct 2026: "build large keep castle in central park. use assets + online assets. very realsitic"; his pick B
// of mockups/castle-v1, "just like this"; its keep taken off the map and stored the same day, archive/keep, its dungeons put under it,
// mockups/castle-v4). The real Norman castles are its guide (Rochester's and the Tower of London's: English Heritage's and the Kent
// listing's descriptions; Central Park's own Belvedere Castle for the place), drawn here in code: squared stone in courses a foot high,
// every block its own shade of a pale grey-brown ragstone, the mortar darker (castleStone); the weather on it, streaks from the top,
// lichen, the foot damp and green with moss (castleWeather); a round-headed arch of dressed voussoirs (castleArch), outside in the pale
