// ---- THE MICE: a run along the foot of a wall from one hole to another (x0, y0 to x1, y1, along one wall), three mice to it. Each waits in
// a hole, comes out, scurries in short dashes with pauses to sniff (its nose twitches), and goes back into one hole or the other. A mouse
